  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_01",
      "hash64": "1BD8F6B3555A4841",
      "text": "……看起来很有精神的孩子们。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_02",
      "hash64": "1BD8F3B3555A4328",
      "text": "吾辈是萨瓦罗。\\c\\n在这堂课上要请大家学习\\n生活上所必需的知识和技能。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_03",
      "hash64": "1BD8F4B3555A44DB",
      "text": "你们当中也有很多人是离开家长，\\n独自一人在宿舍生活的。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_04",
      "hash64": "1BD8F9B3555A4D5A",
      "text": "希望通过吾辈传授的知识，\\n让诸位在衣、食、住上\\r\\n都能提高生活品质。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_05",
      "hash64": "1BD8FAB3555A4F0D",
      "text": "目前你们所在意的\\n应该是“食”吧？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_06",
      "hash64": "1BD8F7B3555A49F4",
      "text": "在野餐时吃三明治的话，\\n就会获得被称为[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]食力[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]的力量，\\r\\n发挥各种各样的效果。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_07",
      "hash64": "1BD8F8B3555A4BA7",
      "text": "不仅能回复体力，\\n还能更容易捕捉宝可梦，\\r\\n以及获得更多经验值之类。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_08",
      "hash64": "1BD8EDB3555A38F6",
      "text": "要是能做出好吃的三明治，\\n还能进一步增加效果。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_09",
      "hash64": "1BD8EEB3555A3AA9",
      "text": "另外，为了获得更好用的食力，\\n在进行烹调的时候\\r\\n有一点非常重要……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_10",
      "hash64": "1BDBFBB3555C8697",
      "text": "那么，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你来回答。\\n为了获得更好用的食力，\\r\\n你会注意什么？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1B0AA1358C89B85C",
      "text": "馅料和调味料",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1B0AA4358C89BD75",
      "text": "烹调的速度",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1B0AA3358C89BBC2",
      "text": "投入感情",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "044A470EB5724ACA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你答得太对了。\\n你是平时会在家里帮忙做饭，\\r\\n所以才早早地就明白了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "044A460EB5724917",
      "text": "……你答错了。\\n比起速度，吾辈更希望\\r\\n你能重视细致度。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "044A450EB5724764",
      "text": "呃……！这是个有趣的回答。\\n虽然不是吾辈想要的答案……\\r\\n但在某种意义上说也是正解。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_11",
      "hash64": "1BDBFAB3555C84E4",
      "text": "为了获得更好用的食力，\\n重要的是馅料和调味料……\\r\\n也就是所谓的食材。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_12",
      "hash64": "1BDBFDB3555C89FD",
      "text": "比如多使用甜味的食材，\\n就会更容易获得蛋蛋力……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_13",
      "hash64": "1BDBFCB3555C884A",
      "text": "多使用苦味的食材，\\n就会更容易获得掉物力，之类。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_14",
      "hash64": "1BDBF7B3555C7FCB",
      "text": "如果能让做出的三明治\\n具备自己想要的效果，\\r\\n料理就会变得更令人满意吧。\\c\\n姑且也说一下，\\n在餐厅用餐也能获得食力哦。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_15",
      "hash64": "1BDBF6B3555C7E18",
      "text": "……如果诸位能掌握这些知识，\\n加深对家政课的理解的话，\\r\\n吾辈也会非常高兴的。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_16",
      "hash64": "1BDBF9B3555C8331",
      "text": "课就上到这里。\\n就此失陪了。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
